{"id":"4999c67bb24a8b0d","group":"73","path":"73/73-ex-zero-l-union-nonclosure.md","title":"两个单元素 0L 语言的并未必为 0L","display":"ex-zero-l-union-nonclosure — 两个单元素 0L 语言的并未必为 0L","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-ex-zero-l-union-nonclosure","aliases":["73-ex-zero-l-union-nonclosure"],"display":"ex-zero-l-union-nonclosure — 两个单元素 0L 语言的并未必为 0L","depends_on":["[[73-df-zero-l-system]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"Example 14.4, p. 391; scan 399","source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Example 14.4, p. 391; scan 399","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-ex-zero-l-union-nonclosure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-ex-zero-l-union-nonclosure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-zero-l-union-nonclosure — 两个单元素 0L 语言的并未必为 0L"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e81a88fc44254236\" href=\"?note=e81a88fc44254236\" title=\"73-df-zero-l-system\">73-df-zero-l-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Example 14.4, p. 391; scan 399"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Example 14.4, p. 391; scan 399"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{a\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{a\\}\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e81a88fc44254236\" href=\"?note=e81a88fc44254236\" title=\"73-df-zero-l-system\">73-df-zero-l-system</a>。单元素词语言在集合构造中显式使用单字符词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}union\\text{-}nonclosure}\\vdash\n\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\},\\{aa\\}\\in\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\{\\langle a\\rangle,aa\\}\\notin\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}union\\text{-}nonclosure}\\vdash\n\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\},\\{aa\\}\\in\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\{\\langle a\\rangle,aa\\}\\notin\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>两单元素语言分别用恒等规则 a→a 和不同的开始词得到。若开始词为 a，为生成 aa 必有 a→aa，此后并行产生 aaaa；若开始词为 aa，为生成 a 必须允许擦除一个位置，但两个位置也能同时擦除而产生 ε。两种情况都使语言多出成员。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-zero-l-system","status":"resolved","id":"e81a88fc44254236","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-zero-l-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-zero-l-system","status":"resolved","id":"e81a88fc44254236","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a\\}$ 为字母表，$\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]。单元素词语言在集合构造中显式使用单字符词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}union\\text{-}nonclosure}\\vdash\n\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\},\\{aa\\}\\in\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\{\\langle a\\rangle,aa\\}\\notin\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":1725,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-356","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-zero-l-union-nonclosure|两个单元素 0L 语言的并未必为 0L]]"}],"outgoing":["e81a88fc44254236"]}